  "uncertain": [
    "Exact numeric values for each region are not printed; coordinates are estimated from axis tick positions, so small reading error is possible (especially Region A and B on the y-axis).",
    "The chart shows a single snapshot with no time dimension, so 'change' or 'trend over time' cannot be assessed from this view alone.",
    "No policy table or explicit decision rule is supplied linking the observed ad-spend/sales relationship to a specific form option; the mapping from chart evidence to the three recommendation choices is not defined in the provided text."
